          "description": "Evenly spread the mustard sauce on the cut sides of the bread halves."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "layer-fillings-cuban-sandwiches",
        "en": {
          "title": "Layer the fillings",
          "description": "Place slices of ham, pork, cheese, and pickles on the bottom half of the bread, then close with the top half."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "heat-grill-pan-cuban-sandwiches",
        "en": {
          "title": "Heat the grill pan",
          "description": "Lightly oil a grill pan and heat it over medium heat."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "cook-first-side-cuban-sandwiches",
        "en": {
          "title": "Cook the first side",
          "description": "Place the assembled sandwich on the hot pan, press it down with a heavy skillet to flatten to one-third of its original thickness, and cook for 1–2 minutes until golden brown."
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "flip-cook-second-side-cuban-sandwiches",
        "en": {
          "title": "Flip and cook the second side",
          "description": "Flip the sandwich, press again with the heavy skillet, and cook for another 1–2 minutes until the cheese is melted and the bread is golden."
        }
